/* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   TOKENS
   Colour  — navy #0B1B33 (ink / structure), saffron #FF6A13 (primary
   accent, "the flame"), gold #C9962C (ceremonial trim, used sparingly),
   marigold-cream #FFF6EA (page ground), maroon-ember #7A1F1F (deep
   accent for the achievements band).
   Type    — "Baloo 2" for the Hindi/display voice, "Inter" for body
   copy, "Noto Sans Devanagari" to render Hindi cleanly inside Inter.
   Signature — the party emblem (trishul + damru inside a mandala ring)
   used as the one recurring bold mark: logo, hero watermark, divider.

   IMPORTANT: this environment serves a static, pre-built Tailwind
   stylesheet with no JIT compiler, so bracketed arbitrary-value
   classes (e.g. bg-[var(--x)], text-[13px], opacity-[0.07]) silently
   fail to render. All brand colours, hover states and precise
   numeric values below are implemented as real CSS in GLOBAL_CSS or
   as inline style objects instead of arbitrary Tailwind classes.
   Only standard, finite-scale Tailwind utilities (flex, grid, spacing,
   rounded-*, shadow-*, text-sm/base/lg/xl.., font-weight, responsive
   sm:/md:/lg: prefixes) are used alongside them.
------------------------------------------------------------------------ */

